@startuml
title ReadVSD — operation / eGK reservation lifecycle

[*] --> Validating

Validating --> Rejected : PerformOnlineCheck=true /\nReadOnlineReceipt=true /\ninvalid context (FR-007/008/010)
Validating --> Reserving : flags=false, context ok

Reserving --> CardBusy : eGK already reserved (FR-029)
Reserving --> CheckingEgk : reservation acquired (TUC_KON_023)

CheckingEgk --> Failed : DF.HCA blocked (114) /\ncert invalid (107/106) (FR-015)
CheckingEgk --> Authenticating : eGK usable

Authenticating --> Failed : PIN.SMC/PIN.CH not set\n(3041/3042) (FR-012)
Authenticating --> ReadingMandatory : C2C done\n(AUT_VSD reached or GVD will be skipped)

ReadingMandatory --> Failed : StatusVD='1' (3001) /\ncontainer read error (3011)
ReadingMandatory --> ReadingProtected : PD+VD+Status read;\nC2C authorised GVD
ReadingMandatory --> Auditing : PD+VD+Status read;\nGVD not authorised (omit, FR-021)

ReadingProtected --> Failed : GVD read error (3011)
ReadingProtected --> Auditing : GVD read (SM-wrapped)

Auditing --> Failed : audit write failed -> no VSD (FR-023)
Auditing --> Releasing : audit written

Releasing --> Succeeded : response built (no PN)

Reserving --> Failed : timeout (FR-027)
CheckingEgk --> Failed : timeout (FR-027)
Authenticating --> Failed : timeout (FR-027)
ReadingMandatory --> Failed : timeout (FR-027)
ReadingProtected --> Failed : timeout (FR-027)

Failed --> Releasing : release eGK reservation
Rejected --> [*]
CardBusy --> [*]
Succeeded --> [*]
note bottom of Releasing : reservation always released\non success or abort
@enduml
